11
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:36,200
Look how high he jumps!

12
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,400
Complete the task:

13
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,420
Ribbit and jump like a froggy!

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,680
Froggy has a splashy gift for you!

15
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,200
A fun coloring page.

16
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:51,440
Parents, grab it for free in our bio!